      },
      "lineNbr": 85,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T07:35:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not just adding the UUID to the HypervisorBackend enum? we can have something like \n```\nmatch query_vendor_hyp_call_uid() {\nHypervisorBackend::Kvm.uuid() \u003d\u003e ..\n...\n```\nIt\u0027s more straightforward and we don\u0027t need to add another layer of abstraction",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 85,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "3f8299782b52da68727d0cb006ec65dbbb832fb0",
